{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Jevil — the jester who believes everything is a game\n\nSecret boss of Ch.1, the first known bearer of the Shadow Crystal. Former court jester of the Card Kingdom.","x":-200,"y":-100,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jevil.gif","x":-90,"y":-340,"width":169,"height":166},{"id":"seam","type":"text","text":"**Seam**\nHis actual best friend — he had to lock him up on the previous Kings' orders, and still asks about him chapters later.","x":-750,"y":-120,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"seam-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Seam_Face.webp","x":-720,"y":-350,"width":140,"height":113},{"id":"king","type":"text","text":"**King**\nJevil told him about the glory of the Roaring Knight and the Fountain — the spark of his ambition and downfall (revealed in Ch.4).","x":700,"y":-520,"width":290,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"king-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_face.png","x":740,"y":-750,"width":150,"height":181},{"id":"cristal_oscuro","type":"text","text":"**First Bearer of the Shadow Crystal**\nAwakened by Someone Strange — the same pattern later repeated with Spamton, the Knight, Gerson, and Pink.","x":700,"y":-140,"width":290,"height":190,"color":"3"},{"id":"cristal_oscuro-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shadow_Crystal_item.webp","x":760,"y":-370,"width":86,"height":110},{"id":"patron_lightner","type":"text","text":"**'Increasingly Lightner' pattern**\nJevil is the purest starting point on the scale: a normal Darkner, unlike Spamton, the Knight, or Gerson.","x":700,"y":130,"width":290,"height":190,"color":"3"},{"id":"spamton","type":"text","text":"**Spamton**\nBoth are bearers of the Shadow Crystal, contacted by the same kind of mysterious figure. Spamton sees him as a rival to surpass.","x":-200,"y":540,"width":290,"height":180,"color":"1"},{"id":"spamton-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/spamton.gif","x":-140,"y":760,"width":150,"height":169},{"id":"everyman","type":"text","text":"**Everyman**\nNon-canon cameo: 1 out of every 50 duck faces in his carousel attack can be replaced by his head.","x":-800,"y":600,"width":280,"height":170,"color":"1"},{"id":"everyman-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/jevil_Everyman_attack_ducks.png","x":-800,"y":810,"width":200,"height":102},{"id":"ruta_rara_susie","type":"text","text":"**Origin of Susie's Weird Route?**\nBet30 (Ch.3), Scythemare (Ch.5), and the sermon's 'rare card' suggest his influence lingers in Susie's kit. Fan theory, unconfirmed.","x":250,"y":540,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"comodin_diseno","type":"text","text":"**He's the Joker card**\nHis real identity in the Light World, according to Dark World Objects — hence why he uses attacks from all 4 suits without a suit limit.","x":1150,"y":-150,"width":290,"height":190,"color":"1"},{"id":"roaring_knight","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nJevil is the one who told King about his glory, long before the Knight himself appeared in the story.","x":-1250,"y":-460,"width":290,"height":190,"color":"1"},{"id":"roaring_knight-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/TheRoaringKnightDeltarune.webp","x":-1250,"y":-690,"width":150,"height":171},{"id":"alguien_extrano","type":"text","text":"**Is 'Someone Strange' Gaster?**\nThe same kind of static ('garbage noise') as Undertale's Entry Number 17. Strong theory, unconfirmed.","x":-910,"y":200,"width":310,"height":200,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_center_img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_seam","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"seam","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_seam_img","fromNode":"seam-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"seam","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_king","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"king","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_king_img","fromNode":"king-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"king","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_alguien_extrano","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"alguien_extrano","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_cristal_oscuro","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"cristal_oscuro","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_cristal_oscuro_img","fromNode":"cristal_oscuro-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"cristal_oscuro","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_patron_lightner","fromNode":"cristal_oscuro","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"patron_lightner","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_spamton","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"spamton","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_spamton_img","fromNode":"spamton-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"spamton","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"e_everyman","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"everyman","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_everyman_img","fromNode":"everyman-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"everyman","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"e_ruta_rara_susie","fromNode":"spamton","fromSide":"right","toNode":"ruta_rara_susie","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_comodin_diseno","fromNode":"cristal_oscuro","fromSide":"right","toNode":"comodin_diseno","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e_roaring_knight","fromNode":"seam","fromSide":"left","toNode":"roaring_knight","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_roaring_knight_img","fromNode":"roaring_knight-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"roaring_knight","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_king_knight","fromNode":"king","fromSide":"left","toNode":"roaring_knight","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}